Build and run
-------------

Requires a C17 compiler and Make.

  make run
  make debug
  make release

The project uses a unity build: main.c includes the helper .c files and is
the only source passed to the compiler. Add new implementation files with
#include "your_file.c" in main.c. Do not compile included .c files separately.
All included files share one translation unit, so file-scope names (including
static functions and variables) must be unique across the project.
